        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Guy Ritchie, Jason Statham, Ray Liotta, Vincent Pastore, André Benjamin, Kamay Lau, Mark Neveldine, Brian Taylor\n- Films: Revolver, Crank: High Voltage\n- Roles: Chev Chelios\n- Topics: acting, directing, writing, modeling, competitive diving\n\nFacts:\n- Jason Statham was born on 26 July 1967 and is an English actor, former model, and former competitive diver.\n- Revolver is a 2005 British-French crime thriller film co-written and directed by Guy Ritchie.\n- Revolver stars Jason Statham, Ray Liotta, Vincent Pastore, and André Benjamin.\n- Kamay Lau is a British actress best known as the failed hitlady in Revolver.\n- Crank: High Voltage was written and directed by Mark Neveldine and Brian Taylor.\n- In Crank: High Voltage, Jason Statham reprises the role of Chev Chelios.",
